(13, 'CAPA/8/25-26/011', '2026-03-26 12:50:22', 'APPL007', 'checked', 'CAPA', 'The issue was identified during review stage and corrected before batch release; therefore, no impact on product quality is anticipated.', 'Line clearance was not performed as per SOP before starting compression activity.', 'SDN No. 002', '2026-03-26', 'Quality Assurance', 'Internal Audits', '2026-03-26 12:50:37', 'APPL007', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '8', '25-26', 11),
(14, 'CAPA/8/25-26/012', '2026-03-26 12:51:51', 'APPL007', 'Checked Seven Step By Dept Head', 'CAPA', 'The deviation may have minor impact on process consistency; however, initial evaluation indicates no direct impact on product quality. Risk is considered moderate.', 'During analysis by High Performance Liquid Chromatography, system suitability criteria (%RSD) was found outside acceptance limit as per STP.', 'SDN No. 003', '2026-03-26', 'Quality Assurance', 'Trending the Data', '2026-03-26 12:52:00', 'APPL007', 'During granulation, excess binder was added beyond specified limit as per BMR.', 'Incorrect calculation of binder quantity.', '2026-03-26', '2026-03-28', 'Human error (lack of training)\nCalculation mistake\nSOP not clear\nEquipment malfunction\nMaterial issue\nEnvironmental variation\nLack of supervision', 'Training records reviewed â†’ Operator not trained.', 'Root cause identified as incorrect binder calculation by operator due to lack of training and absence of independent verification step in BMR.', '[{\"task\":\"To correct the issue and control the current non-conformity.\",\"department\":\"Quality Assurance\",\"targetDate\":\"2026-04-09\"}]', '[{\"task\":\"Stop the ongoing process/activity\",\"department\":\"Quality Assurance\",\"targetDate\":\"2026-04-09\"}]', '2026-03-26 01:03:20', 'APPL007', '2026-03-26 03:48:42', 'Cyclone', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'Done', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '8', '25-26', 12),
