(17, 'CAPA/8/25-26/015', '2026-03-26 02:26:27', 'APPL007', 'CAPA Extended Approved by QA Head', 'CAPA', 'The non-conformity may impact critical quality attributes; therefore, the affected batch has been kept under quarantine pending detailed investigation.', 'Overwriting without proper justification and sign was found in analytical record.', 'SDN No. 005', '2026-03-26', 'Quality Assurance', 'Regulatory Inspection', '2026-03-26 02:26:57', 'APPL007', 'Preliminary assessment indicates [low/moderate/high] risk on product quality. Affected batch is kept under [quarantine/hold].', 'Absence of second-person verification', '2026-03-26', '2026-04-02', 'BMR checked â†’ No verification step', 'Review of training records confirmed that operator was not trained on revised BMR. Equipment and material found compliant.', 'Root cause identified as incorrect binder calculation by operator due to lack of training and absence of independent verification step in BMR.', '[{\"task\":\"Place affected batch under Quarantine\",\"department\":\"Quality Assurance\",\"targetDate\":\"2026-03-26\"}]', '[{\"task\":\"Retrain concerned personnel on relevant SOP/BMR\",\"department\":\"Quality Assurance\",\"targetDate\":\"2026-03-26\"}]', '2026-03-26 02:31:26', 'APPL007', '2026-03-26 02:32:30', 'APPL007', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'Done', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'Yes', 'Yes', 'ok', 'Yes', '2026-03-26', 'Cyclone', '2026-03-26 03:41:56', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ok', '2026-03-26 03:43:20', 'Cyclone', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '8', '25-26', 15),
(18, 'CAPA/8/25-26/016', '2026-03-26 02:36:45', 'APPL007', 'Task Follow Up', 'CAPA', 'Incorrect process parameter may affect product performance; further evaluation is required.', 'Preventive maintenance was not performed within due date.', 'SDN No. 005', '2026-03-26', 'Quality Assurance', 'Regulatory Inspection', '2026-03-26 02:37:00', 'APPL007', 'Operator not trained on revised BMR.', 'Preliminary assessment indicates low risk to product quality. The affected batch is kept under quarantine pending investigation.', '2026-03-26', '2026-04-02', 'Operator error / lack of training', 'Training record reviewed â†’ Not trained', 'Root cause identified as incorrect machine setting during compression due to lack of training and absence of verification step in SOP.', '[{\"task\":\"Retrain concerned personnel on relevant SOP/BMR\",\"department\":\"Quality Assurance\",\"targetDate\":\"2026-03-26\"}]', '[{\"task\":\"Verify correction before resuming activity\",\"department\":\"Quality Assurance\",\"targetDate\":\"2026-04-02\"}]', '2026-03-26 02:53:24', 'APPL007', '2026-03-26 02:54:10', 'APPL007', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'Done', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'Yes', 'Yes', 'ok', 'Yes', '2026-03-26', 'Cyclone', '2026-03-26 03:46:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '8', '25-26', 16),
(19, 'CAPA/8/25-26/017', '2026-03-26 03:29:29', 'APPL013', 'initiated', 'CAPA', 'The non-conformity may lead to cross-contamination, potentially affecting product quality and patient safety. The risk is considered moderate to high, depending on the extent of contamination and detection stage. Immediate corrective and preventive actions are required to ensure compliance with GMP standards.', 'Repeated observations of inadequate equipment cleaning in Capsule Section â€“ Line 2 were identified during data trending and internal review. Residual traces from previous batches indicate non-compliance with established cleaning procedures.', 'INR-QA-2026-015', '2026-03-27', 'Quality Assurance', 'Trending the Data', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '8', '25-26', 17),
