(5, '142', 'Quality Control', '44', 'AEQP-044', '2026-03-25', 'APPL004', '2026-03-25 03:05:47', 'Pending', 'On 25th March at approximately 03 PM, a breakdown was observed in the Quality Control (QC) department involving [Instrument Name â€“ e.g., HPLC / GC / UV Spectrophotometer / Dissolution Apparatus] during routine analysis.\n\nThe issue was identified when [mention problem â€“ e.g., abnormal readings, system error, pressure fluctuation, instrument not starting, software failure, etc.] was observed while performing [test name / product / batch no.].\n\nDue to this breakdown, ongoing analysis activities were interrupted, leading to a delay in sample testing and reporting. The instrument was immediately stopped to prevent further damage and ensure data integrity.\n\nInitial inspection indicated that the possible cause may be [mention suspected cause â€“ e.g., pump failure, column blockage, detector issue, power fluctuation, software malfunction].\n\nThe issue has been reported to the Engineering / Maintenance Department for further investigation and corrective action.\n\nImpact:\n\nDelay in QC sample analysis\nPotential impact on batch release timelines\nNo impact on product quality (if applicable)\n\nImmediate Action Taken:\n\nInstrument usage stopped\nSamples kept on hold under controlled conditions\nBreakdown logged in system\nMaintenance team informed', 'N/A', NULL, NULL, NULL, '005', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'pending', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'APPL004', '2026-03-25 03:05:47', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(6, '142', 'Production', '41', 'AEQP-041', '2026-03-27', 'APPL013', '2026-03-26 06:28:18', 'Pending', 'During routine operation, the analytical balance displayed inconsistent readings and failed calibration check. Immediate removal from service is required to prevent impact on batch analysis.', 'YES', NULL, NULL, NULL, '006', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'pending', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'APPL013', '2026-03-26 06:28:18', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
