(3, 'RM-QTF-001', '1126', '[{\"parameter\":\"Sample Handling\",\"discrption\":\"Sample shall be handled carefully to prevent contamination and moisture exposure during analysis\",\"spec_limit\":\"As per approved sampling and handling procedure\"},{\"parameter\":\"Instrument Calibration\",\"discrption\":\"All instruments used for testing shall be calibrated and within calibration validity before use.\",\"spec_limit\":\"Calibration status shall be valid\"},{\"parameter\":\"Chemical and Reagent Handling\",\"discrption\":\"Use approved chemicals, reagents and reference standards within their validity period.\",\"spec_limit\":\"Reagents shall comply with approved requirements\"},{\"parameter\":\"Reference Standard Handling\",\"discrption\":\"Use qualified reference standard for identification and assay testing.\",\"spec_limit\":\"Valid reference standard shall be used\"},{\"parameter\":\"Test Environment\",\"discrption\":\"Perform analysis under controlled laboratory conditions as per GMP requirements.\",\"spec_limit\":\"As per laboratory procedure\"},{\"parameter\":\"Documentation\",\"discrption\":\"Record all observations, calculations and results in approved analytical records.\",\"spec_limit\":\"Complete and accurate documentation required\"},{\"parameter\":\"Safety Precautions\",\"discrption\":\"Follow appropriate safety precautions while handling API, chemicals and solvents.\",\"spec_limit\":\"As per laboratory safety procedure\"},{\"parameter\":\"Result Evaluation\",\"discrption\":\"Test results shall be reviewed against approved specification limits before approval.\",\"spec_limit\":\"Results shall comply with specification\"}]', 'To define the analytical testing procedure and acceptance criteria for the evaluation of Quetiapine Fumarate ER Active Pharmaceutical Ingredient (API) to ensure compliance with approved quality specifications and applicable pharmaceutical standards.', 'Quetiapine Fumarate ER Reference Standard Solution: Prepared using qualified Quetiapine Fumarate ER working/reference standard as per approved analytical method.', 'Standard Solution: Quetiapine Fumarate ER Reference Standard solution prepared in specified diluent as per approved analytical method.', 'This Method of Analysis (MOA) is applicable for the testing and evaluation of Quetiapine Fumarate ER Active Pharmaceutical Ingredient (API). The procedure covers identification, assay, water content, related substances, residual solvents, and other quality control tests required to confirm compliance with approved raw material specifications', '[]', '[]', '[{\"term\":\"API (Active Pharmaceutical Ingredient)\",\"defination\":\"The active component of a pharmaceutical product that produces the intended therapeutic effect.\"},{\"term\":\"MOA (Method of Analysis)\",\"defination\":\"A documented procedure describing the analytical method used for testing and evaluation of a material.\"}]', 'Medicap', '2026-07-31 10:54:00', '2026-07-31 02:06:58'),
(4, 'SPEC-RAN-ER-001', '1126', '[]', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', '[]', '[]', '[]', 'Medicap', '2026-07-31 02:10:58', NULL),
(5, 'RM-SPEC-104120002-01', '1126', '[]', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', '[]', '[]', '[]', 'APPL066', '2026-08-05 10:42:12', NULL),
(6, 'RM-017012', '1126', '[]', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', '[]', '[]', '[]', 'Medicap', '2026-08-06 03:02:38', NULL);
